// Dead man's brace — a rigid brace that steadies the aim: adds a GRADUATED per-item
// WeaponBraceBonus of §1a stability-score points (a tighter cone / less recoil climb).
// Data-driven attachment ITEM (the grimdark "DeadmansBrace" tag), mapped to the Stability
// effect — brace stability, DISTINCT from a sight's Aim (Accuracy) bonus. The magnitude lives
// HERE on the item; applied post-spawn.
(
    display_name: "Dead Man's Brace",
    slot: Rail,  // an under-rail rigid brace / foregrip — the Rail slot
    effects: [
        Stability(20.0),  // +20 stability-score points (graduated brace) — tunable
    ],
)
